  "description": "Seo-Hui, a superhero manga otaku, developed a drug to alter parts of his body with the single-minded goal of becoming a hero. He even forced himself to conduct human trials, but the drug's side effects caused his male genitalia to transform into female genitalia. Tae-O, who had long harbored a secret crush on Seo-Hui, seized this opportunity and approached him...\n\n*“It's not that you don't have one, senior. You just don't know how to use it, right? Want to test it out?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
